msgstr "Mode pistolet"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Video"
msgstr "Vidéo"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Wait for vertical blank before presenting.\n"
"Prevents tearing but adds up to one frame of latency."
msgstr ""
"Attendre le retour vertical avant l'affichage.\n"
"Évite le déchirement mais ajoute jusqu'à une image de latence."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Notifications"
msgstr "Notifications"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Automatic (system)"
msgstr "Automatique (système)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Langue"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "GPU"
msgstr "GPU"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Auto (best)"
msgstr "Auto (meilleur)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Renderer"
msgstr "Moteur de rendu"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Software"
msgstr "Logiciel"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Which renderer draws the game. Applies on the\n"
"next launch - save settings and relaunch."
msgstr ""
"Moteur de rendu utilisé pour le jeu. S'applique au\n"
"prochain lancement : enregistrez puis relancez."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Window size"
msgstr "Taille de la fenêtre"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Width"
msgstr "Largeur"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Height"
msgstr "Hauteur"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "1x (native)"
msgstr "1x (natif)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "8x (4K)"
msgstr "8x (4K)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "3D render scale"
msgstr "Échelle du rendu 3D"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Internal 3D rendering resolution. Higher is crisper 3D\n"
"(2D/HUD stays sharp). GPU backends only; the software\n"
"renderer stays native. Applies on the next launch - save\n"
"settings and relaunch."
msgstr ""
"Résolution interne du rendu 3D. Plus élevée, la 3D est\n"
"plus nette (la 2D/HUD reste nette). GPU uniquement ;\n"
"le rendu logiciel reste natif. S'applique au prochain\n"
"lancement : enregistrez puis relancez."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Bilinear"
msgstr "Bilinéaire"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Integer"
msgstr "Entier"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Nearest"
msgstr "Plus proche"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sharp-bilinear"
msgstr "Bilinéaire net"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "2D scaling"
msgstr "Mise à l'échelle 2D"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"How the frame is magnified to the window.\n"
"Sharp-bilinear keeps 2D text crisp without the shimmer\n"
"nearest shows at non-integer window sizes. Integer snaps\n"
"to a whole multiple (pixel-perfect, with black bars).\n"
"Applies live."
msgstr ""
"Comment l'image est agrandie dans la fenêtre.\n"
"Bilinéaire net garde le texte 2D net sans le scintillement\n"
"de Plus proche aux tailles non entières. Entier s'aligne\n"
"sur un multiple exact (pixel parfait, avec bandes noires).\n"
"S'applique en direct."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "4:3 (arcade)"
msgstr "4:3 (arcade)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Square pixels"
msgstr "Pixels carrés"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Stretch"
msgstr "Étirer"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Aspect"
msgstr "Format"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"4:3 is the arcade monitor's shape (the default).\n"
"Square pixels shows the raw 496x384 (slightly narrow).\n"
"Stretch fills the whole window. Applies live."
msgstr ""
"4:3 est la forme du moniteur d'arcade (par défaut).\n"
"Pixels carrés affiche le 496x384 brut (un peu étroit).\n"
"Étirer remplit toute la fenêtre. S'applique en direct."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "CRT filter"
msgstr "Filtre CRT"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A cosmetic arcade-monitor look over the finished frame:\n"
"scanlines, an RGB shadow mask, glow and optional screen\n"
"curvature. Purely visual; applies live."
msgstr ""
"Un aspect moniteur d'arcade sur l'image finale :\n"
"lignes de balayage, masque RVB, halo et courbure\n"
"d'écran facultative. Purement visuel ; en direct."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scanlines"
msgstr "Lignes de balayage"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mask"
msgstr "Masque"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Glow"
msgstr "Halo"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Curvature"
msgstr "Courbure"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enhancement (cosmetic, beyond the original hardware)"
msgstr "Amélioration (cosmétique, au-delà du matériel d'origine)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Anisotropic"
msgstr "Anisotrope"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Faithful"
msgstr "Fidèle"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "3D texture filter"
msgstr "Filtre de texture 3D"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "(unsupported)"
msgstr "(non pris en charge)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "This GPU does not report anisotropic filtering."
msgstr "Ce GPU ne signale pas de filtrage anisotrope."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Anisotropy"
msgstr "Anisotropie"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "2D upscale"
msgstr "Agrandissement 2D"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Edge-smooth the 2D layers (HUD, text, menus). xBR and\n"
"ScaleFX round diagonals; Faithful keeps crisp pixels.\n"
"Applies live."
msgstr ""
"Lisse les contours des couches 2D (HUD, texte, menus).\n"
"xBR et ScaleFX arrondissent les diagonales ; Fidèle\n"
"garde des pixels nets. S'applique en direct."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Blended"
msgstr "Mélangé"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Stipple"
msgstr "Tramé"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Translucency"
msgstr "Transparence"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The hardware draws see-through surfaces (lights, glass,\n"
"shadows) as a checkerboard. Blended draws the 50%\n"
"see-through surface it's trying to achieve. Applies live."
msgstr ""
"Le matériel dessine les surfaces transparentes (lumières,\n"
"vitres, ombres) en damier. Mélangé dessine la surface\n"
"transparente à 50% visée. S'applique en direct."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Custom textures"
msgstr "Textures personnalisées"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Replace the game's 3D textures with images saved in\n"
"saves/textures/<game>/load, named as dumped. GPU\n"
"renderers only; Reload picks up edited files."
msgstr ""
"Remplace les textures 3D du jeu par des images placées\n"
"dans saves/textures/<game>/load, nommées comme extraites.\n"
"GPU uniquement ; Recharger prend en compte les modifications."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%zu loaded"
msgstr "%zu chargées"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reload"
msgstr "Recharger"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Dump textures"
msgstr "Extraire les textures"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Collect every 3D texture the game draws and write them,\n"
"with an index.html to browse, to saves/textures/<game>/dump\n"
"when the game exits or this is turned off."
msgstr ""
"Collecte chaque texture 3D affichée par le jeu et les écrit,\n"
"avec un index.html pour les parcourir, dans\n"
"saves/textures/<game>/dump à la sortie du jeu ou à l'arrêt."

